summary:
Ford Motor Co. (F, Financials) reported an 8.9% year-over-year decline in U.S. vehicle sales for February 2025, with total deliveries reaching 158,675 units, according to the company's sales data. Year-to-date sales fell 7.7% to 301,619 vehicles.

Warning! GuruFocus has detected 4 Warning Signs with F.

While hybrid and electric vehicle sales showed increases, internal combustion engine car sales dropped 12.7% in February to 135,992 units. Sales of hybrid vehicles climbed 27.5% to 15,357 units;
